# harness.pdl - the deskopoly book's harness rows (2026-11-08), read by harness_menu_op: they show in the editor Harness tab when the deskopoly book is open (any page) and, with the global rows, in the top taskbar cell.
# HARNESS | id | page | kind | label | target | args | writes | confirm | note      (grammar: &.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/harness_menu_op.c header). The global `deskopoly` row (the mini engine, 105 checks) is in #.desktop/harness_menu.pdl.
# Each CASE runs behind cpu_gate and its verdict is shown beside the label, so the editor displays the real pass count of the real case file after every run.
HARNESS | dsk_classic | * | CASE | classic data   | dsk_classic | - | - | no | the classic board data, the lobby, the opening and the tamper tests (milestone M2)
HARNESS | dsk_play    | * | CASE | classic play   | dsk_play    | - | - | no | roll, landing, rent, buy, bankruptcy to a player, over, stalemate (milestone M3)
HARNESS | dsk_jail    | * | CASE | classic jail   | dsk_jail    | - | - | no | doubles, Go To Jail, the Jail turn (pay, roll for doubles, forced fine), debt rules (milestone M4)
HARNESS | dsk_cards   | * | CASE | classic cards  | dsk_cards   | - | - | no | the Luck and Fund decks: every effect kind, the kept Get Out card, chained card moves, loader refusals (milestone M5)
HARNESS | dsk_build   | * | CASE | classic build  | dsk_build   | - | - | no | houses, hotels, the supply, mortgages, pay_debt, net worth, bankruptcy with mortgage interest (milestone M6)
HARNESS | dsk_page    | * | CASE | classic page   | dsk_page    | - | - | no | the map the editor draws during Play: houses, hotels, mortgages and player rows from the ledger, one voxel high, marker cap, tamper refusal
HARNESS | dsk_driver  | * | CASE | classic driver | dsk_driver  | - | - | no | the real Play driver: setup, START, pause, step, the walk, stop, owner exit, restart from the ledger (about 30 s)
